ive because $\\sech u$ decreases for $u>0$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186490430 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "14d4647a-6d5f-5a8b-afc7-b4c99985c53d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{5}{3}\\csch^{2} (\\frac{3x}{5}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490415} {:answer/id #uuid "2280ea0f-e99f-54d1-b953-8e1352531ba6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}\\tanh (\\frac{3x}{5})\\sech (\\frac{3x}{5}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490421} {:answer/id #uuid "2e5e927e-132b-5ec0-8ee9-f3ec47118484" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}\\tanh^{2} (\\frac{3x}{5}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490423} {:answer/id #uuid "bcfd724e-b61b-572a-adf5-c29284ca88ce" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{5}{3}\\tanh (\\frac{3x}{5}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490466} {:answer/id #uuid "f3d02798-e382-5370-91b5-fc2a625a50e0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5\\tanh (\\frac{5x}{3}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490479}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "bcfd724e-b61b-572a-adf5-c29284ca88ce" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{5}{3}\\tanh (\\frac{3x}{5}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490466} :answer-field/id #uuid "dcaae30b-0606-5dce-8c2b-ca47cd3a198e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490474}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "4af78c3a-0b06-546c-acb1-145e9219e3f2" :question/problem "Calculate the integral $\\displaystyle \\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\int\\sech^{2} (\\frac{3x}{5})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$." :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{3x}{5}$. Differentiating gives $\\mathrm{d}u=\\frac{3}{5}\\,\\mathrm{d}x$, so $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{5}{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$.\n\nUsing the substitution and $\\f