 "-\\frac{1}{2}\\sinh (x^{2}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186492154} {:answer/id #uuid "720cce27-0318-5bf7-8a10-83287b4bf4c8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\sinh (x^{2}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186492155} {:answer/id #uuid "b3faba19-8b48-53e8-af6a-aebb974dc5d9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\sinh (6x^{2}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186492174} {:answer/id #uuid "b575eed4-3020-5b1d-aec7-79fa0abe0f88" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}\\sinh (3x^{2}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186492175}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b575eed4-3020-5b1d-aec7-79fa0abe0f88" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}\\sinh (3x^{2}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186492175} :answer-field/id #uuid "e1ecbc49-9055-53f1-bb80-6d44cd9721e1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186492189}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "d3573d29-cf99-5aea-9d53-ca98353732e6" :question/problem "Calculate $\\int x\\cosh (3x^{2})dx$." :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3x^2$. Differentiating gives $\\mathrm{d}u=6x\\,\\mathrm{d}x$, so $x\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{6}\\mathrm{d}u$.\n\nUsing this substitution,\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n\\int x\\cosh(3x^2)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n&=\\frac{1}{6}\\int\\cosh u\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\n&=\\frac{1}{6}\\sinh u+C \\\\\n&=\\frac{1}{6}\\sinh(3x^2)+C.\n\\end{aligned}$$\n\nThis antiderivative is defined for every real $x$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186492188 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1ef51396-68be-5b55-960f-bb1efbc5e38a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{e^{3} - 1}{2e^{3} + 1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186492138} {:answer/id #uuid "53c49835-a6a0-51c7-a71a-07b6a549269d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1 - 2e^{3}}{e^{6} + 1}" :db/id #edb/re