id "83bf2fff-9ebe-5dc2-b39f-545531afe11d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}\\sinh (x^{2}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186492162} {:answer/id #uuid "9a53a2ca-ebfa-50fe-a97c-e2eefb1e56da" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\sinh (x^{2}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186492165} {:answer/id #uuid "bb2f380c-f475-5adc-ae27-2eb3542ba357" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{8}\\sinh (4x^{2}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186492178} {:answer/id #uuid "bf40f749-2f3c-5989-8421-867b97a01280" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{8}\\sinh (4x^{2}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186492179}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "bb2f380c-f475-5adc-ae27-2eb3542ba357" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{8}\\sinh (4x^{2}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186492178} :answer-field/id #uuid "eb906681-09b5-5c46-8e5a-d601590f6987" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186492193}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "e3c5adc8-9287-51f8-a14a-869f0d70a6d5" :question/problem "Calculate $\\int x\\cosh (4x^{2})dx$." :question/worked-solution "Let $u=4x^2$. Differentiating gives $\\mathrm{d}u=8x\\,\\mathrm{d}x$, so $x\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{8}\\mathrm{d}u$.\n\nUsing this substitution,\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n\\int x\\cosh(4x^2)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n&=\\frac{1}{8}\\int\\cosh u\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\n&=\\frac{1}{8}\\sinh u+C \\\\\n&=\\frac{1}{8}\\sinh(4x^2)+C.\n\\end{aligned}$$\n\nThis antiderivative is defined for every real $x$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186492192 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "337fa034-4dc7-530b-961f-b74c8f0de845" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}\\sinh (x^{2}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186492141} {:answer/id #uuid "382a764a-ddfb-5fb7-9def-0ff40ca7c199" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\sinh (x^{2}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186492143} {:answer/id #uuid "544ff240-bc47-5591-b393-9008a0d0fb07" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\sinh (14x^{2}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186492148} {:answer/id #uuid "dfe8f39a-4b32-5c7c-a9bc-e3865fab3ef5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{14}\\sinh (7x^{2}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186492187} {:answer/id #uuid "e6fea7ff-a2d7-5aa2-a685-dfe32fdd168f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{14}\\sinh (7x^{2}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186492191}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e6fea7ff-a2d7-5aa2-a685-dfe32fdd168f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{14}\\sinh (7x^{2}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186492191} :answer-field/id #uuid "f48a2f6d-9c34-565f-936f-66db7bb30b9b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186492196}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "eb00b4d8-60fc-52ce-9ab6-555418c95be5" :question/problem "Calculate $\\int x\\cosh (7x^{2})dx$." :question/worked-solution "Let $u=7x^2$. Differentiating gives $\\mathrm{d}u=14x\\,\\mathrm{d}x$, so $x\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{14}\\mathrm{d}u$.\n\nUsing this substitution,\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n\\int x\\cosh(7x^2)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n&=\\frac{1}{14}\\int\\cosh u\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\n&=\\frac{1}{14}\\sinh u+C \\\\\n&=\\frac{1}{14}\\sinh(7x^2)+C.\n\\end{aligned}$$\n\nThis antiderivative is defined for every real $x$."}] :knowledge-point/title "Integrating Products Containing Hyperbolic Functions Using Substitution"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186166787 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186166625 :question/id #uuid "1c7e6096-bb20-53a3-a605-42b72948fe98" :question/math-academy-id "e-8408" :question/problem "Calculate\n$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits} \\displaystyle \\int \\dfrac{x\\sinh{x^2}}{\\cosh{x^2}}\\, \\textrm{d}x$." :question/worked-solution "$$\n\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}\n$$\n\nLet\n\n$$\nu= \\cosh{x^2}\n$$\n\nDifferentiating, we have\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm{d}u}{\\textrm{d}x} = 2x\\sinh{x^2} \\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad \\dfrac{1}{2} \\, \\textrm{d}u = x\\sinh{x^2} \\,\\textrm{d}x\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and compute it, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} \\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits} \\displaystyle \\int \\dfrac{x\\sinh{x^2}}{\\cosh{x^2}}\\, \\textrm{d}x &= \\int \\dfrac{1}{\\cosh{x^2}}\\cdot x\\sinh{x^2}\\, \\textrm{d}x \\\\[5pt] &= \\int \\dfrac{1}{u}\\cdot \\dfrac{1}{2} \\, \\textrm d u \\\\[5pt] &= \\dfrac{1}{2}\\int \\dfrac{1}{u}\\, \\textrm{d}u \\\\[5pt] &= \\dfrac{1}{2}\\ln \\mid u \\mid +C \\\\[5pt] &= \\dfrac{1}{2}\\ln\\left(\\cosh{x^2}\\right)+ C \\end{aligned}\n$$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "c95abaf8-c2ed-500b-a9d4-20c3346367b7" :knowledge-point/key-prerequisites [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050543 :topic/math-academy-id 3251 :topic/title "Differentiating Reciprocal Hyperbolic Functions"}] :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186167387 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "aff36429-0b6f-5b08-8cb1-f9d62a0594fb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}\\ln \\mid 3\\coth x - 1 \\mid + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165531} {:answer/id #uuid "e3a926a7-ebcb-55be-a1d2-c2ae0b0d7c8d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\ln \\mid 3csch x + 1 \\mid + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165532} {:answer/id #uuid "e582cf2c-3005-590e-822f-6f81d5d7084e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{3}\\ln \\mid 3\\coth x + 1 \\mid + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165533} {:answer/id #uuid "2841714b-58f6-5b44-afa8-6918901949b0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\ln \\mid 3csch^{2} x + 1 \\mid + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165534} {:answer/id #uuid "4e9007e0-94ad-5510-8a51-eb0257525d66" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{3}\\ln \\mid csch^{2} x \\mid + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165535}] :answer-field/id #uuid "57b2fff4-6054-5da6-80af-78bc1bf8894f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165530}] :question/id #uuid "40e3120e-37b5-5993-adff-aacb3447faaa" :question/math-academy-id "q-95548" :question/problem "What is $\\displaystyle \\int\\frac{csch^{2} x}{3\\coth x + 1}dx$?"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186167388 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a8063afd-cce4-5f74-8b83-ed3718477fe7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\ln (\\frac{2}{3})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165537} {:answer/id #uuid "d8be87a3-a5b1-5bc3-a6f3-2795511c39cd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\ln 4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165538} {:answer/id #uuid "e1092a83-a319-5239-960f-77cc3317bd0f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\ln (\\frac{4}{5})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165539} {:answer/id #uuid "244e914d-507d-5932-8738-e54884b4cd79" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\ln (\\frac{5}{4})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165540} {:answer/id #uuid "5f294880-361d-558c-b01a-1cf0aa96cca4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\ln (\\frac{3}{3})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165541}] :answer-field/id #uuid "80a068f8-cad5-51dd-bb46-de9b0aeb9f43" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165536}] :question/id #uuid "9270e9d0-67ad-5c9c-bf8b-9efced7fcb35" :question/math-academy-id "q-95551" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral\n$\\displaystyle \\int_{0}^{\\ln 2}\\frac{\\cosh x}{3 + \\sinh x}dx$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186482728 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0693ddaa-d57f-543c-88a6-214dedc7f19e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{7}\\ln \\mid 7\\csch x + 1 \\mid + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186482726} {:answer/id #uuid "24edd72b-715e-5a20-b0ca-bc6d4e2db918" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}\\ln \\mid 7\\coth x - 1 \\mid + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186482736} {:answer/id #uuid "3dbc5a37-f636-5626-9a99-a373d2b4423d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\ln \\mid 7\\csch^{2} x + 1 \\mid + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186482741} {:answer/id #uuid "ee541a2a-4ae9-5a6e-a578-9429f597af8c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{7}\\ln \\mid 7\\coth x + 1 \\mid + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186482792} {:answer/id #uuid "f4b56a90-21a3-5531-9006-1dd7d3e8aa29" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{7}\\ln \\mid \\csch^{2} x \\mid + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186482793}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ee541a2a-4ae9-5a6e-a578-9429f597af8c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{7}\\ln \\mid 7\\coth x + 1 \\mid + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186482792} :answer-field/id #uuid "7302cb6a-8492-5b5f-81a1-bf9531732d52" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186482759}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "0c398ccb-7526-5cc6-8db1-8a59a9908269" :question/problem "What is $\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits} \\displaystyle \\int\\frac{\\csch^{2} x}{7\\coth x + 1}dx$?" :question/worked-solution "$$\n\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n$$\n\nLet $u=7\\coth x+1$. Differentiating gives\n\n$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-7\\csch^2 x,\n\\qquad \\csch^2 x\\,\\mathrm{d}x=-\\frac{1}{7}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.$$\n\nUsing this substitution, we obtain\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n\\int\\frac{\\csch^2 x}{7\\coth x+1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n&=-\\frac{1}{7}\\int\\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\n&=-\\frac{1}{7}\\ln|u|+C \\\\\n&=-\\frac{1}{7}\\ln|7\\coth x+1|+C.\n\\end{aligned}$$\n\nThe antiderivative is valid on each interval where $x\\ne0$ and $7\\coth x+1\\ne0$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186482739 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5e315d9a-b4bf-5cb3-b8f6-6a0dbacad0b8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}\\ln \\mid 5\\csch x + 1 \\mid + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186482751} {:answer/id #uuid "70a7f11a-d3a7-5538-881f-52fd